    "changelog_excerpt": "# 🚀 DMTools Release v1.7.286\n\n## 📝 What's Changed\n\nFull diff: [v1.7.285...v1.7.286](https://github.com/epam/dm.ai/compare/v1.7.285...v1.7.286)\n\n### 🚀 Features\n- Add Atlassian Rovo MCP integration and rovo_* tools (#781) (#792) (aecc05b6)\n- Add FA Universal Agent & Project Memory options and UX improvements to Factory Builder (#770) (f2082c87)\n- Add expectNonZeroExit to cli_execute_command and suppress expected stack traces (IstiN/dmtools-agents#1304) (#790) (f6a9f49f)\n- Add jira_update_comment and jira_delete_comment MCP tools (#786) (#787) (c2660e8b)\n- Enforce CONFLUENCE_DEFAULT_SPACE for implicit-space search (#739) (#789) (a91147cd)\n- Log 400 field validation as WARN with structured error and add ado_get_work_item_type_states (#795) (#797) (c77b133c)\n\n### 🐛 Bug Fixes\n- Make step bar a sticky second header, fix preview column overlap, and make Step 1 title SCM-neutral (#771) (242c21de)\n- Paginate getUserByEmail and build AdoUser from Identities API fallback (#814) (#815) (198cc0d4)\n- Read release badge and softwareVersion from releases.json (#767) (#769) (5a3ec24f)\n- Restore Step 4 CI & Quality Gate section in FactorySetup (#783) (#784) (217e0146)\n- Suppress stack traces and ERROR logs for git exit-code probes (#793) (#798) (ff8c2b79)\n\n### 📦 Dependencies\n- Auth (#773) (df44c147)\n- Auth (#808) (3723fb4d)\n- Aws-core (#774) (25d85c16)\n- Aws-core (#811) (2beaa55d)\n- Bump gradle-wrapper from 9.8.1 to 9.8.2 (#777) (c13a80fd)\n- Bump gradle/actions/setup-gradle from 6.4.0 to 6.4.1 (#804) (bf0944a5)\n- Bump versions.jackson3 from 3.2.3 to 3.2.4 (#775) (db06da3f)\n- Bump versions.poi from 5.5.1 to 6.0.0 (#772) (c4c53cce)\n- Google-auth-library-oauth2-http (#812) (4eea7044)\n- Google-cloud-core from 2.77.0 to 2.78.0 (#807) (5fc9e3a1)\n- Gson from 2.14.0 to 2.15.0 (#813) (7488529a)\n- Jackson-databind (#776) (793a70a6)\n- Okhttp from 5.5.0 to 5.5.1 (#779) (0d720c4b)\n- Regions (#778) (4dde6b46)\n- Regions (#810) (1eb1cc26)\n- Swagger-annotations (#809) (261c59e4)\n\n### 🛠 Maintenance..."
